<HelloFraandsPage title="Safety centre" summary="Pehle niyam samjhein, apni hadon ka dhyaan rakhein." review={false} related={[]}>
<p><strong>Preview:</strong> these pages explain the planned adult calling service. Browsing this site does not activate calls, verification, recording, reports or moderation. Read each page's availability notice before relying on a control.</p>
<h2>What is planned for calls</h2>
<p>The host receives a private caller announcement and chooses whether to accept before the caller is dialled. Platform numbers are planned to hide each person's number from the other. Hosts will be able to press <strong>* to end</strong> or <strong># to end, block and flag an incident</strong>. Either person can hang up normally.</p>
<p>Every connected call is planned to be recorded after spoken notices. Launch moderation reviews recordings after the call, with staff checking flags before confirming strikes. Live AI warnings and call cuts come in a later phase. These controls cannot guarantee safety or confidentiality. Self-harm mentions are for welfare follow-up, never a strike.</p>
<p>You do not owe anyone your number, identity documents, money, private contact or another minute of conversation. Leave if you feel uncomfortable. The <a href="/women-only">women-only guide</a> explains eligibility, boundaries and respectful discussion of women's experiences.</p>
